{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23908","headline":"嵩阳观夜奏霓裳 · 白居易","name":"嵩阳观夜奏霓裳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开元遗曲自凄凉，况近秋天调是商。\n爱者谁人唯白尹，奏时何处在嵩阳。\n回临山月声弥怨，散入松风韵更长。\n子晋少姨闻定怪，人间亦便有霓裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}